# tab-plane-stacked (M8, plan call 3 o): Tab to the plane on the stacked page (800 x 900), judged
# against WebKit, which scrolls a Tab-focused part into view after the page's focus handlers have
# re-rendered: the plane's keys grow the panel by 49 px, pushing the plane to 873.5..1353.5, and
# the page scrolls 454 to show the plane whole (its foot at 899.5). WebKit's plain Tab reaches the
# plane at its 7th stop (it skips the link and the buttons, call 3 f), the port at its 11th
# (Chromium's order), so each side tabs its own count; Chromium's reference shot shows its own 7th
# stop, b's flip toggle, and isn't the judgment's. Then on to the zoom capsule (WebKit's next stop,
# the port's second: Return to origin is between), the page at 421 as the keys' tip goes, and
# back to the plane, 454 again.
size 800 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
ref tab
ref tab
ref tab
ref tab
ref tab
ref tab
ref tab
port tab
port tab
port tab
port tab
port tab
port tab
port tab
port tab
port tab
port tab
port tab
wait 16
shot plane
ref tab
port tab
port tab
wait 16
shot zoom
ref tab shift
port tab shift
port tab shift
wait 16
shot back-to-plane
